ng depth>=2 symlink hops as `open failed`. Revert reproduces the exact reported string.\n+- FINDING (N24): arm-drop spelling KILLS (`target special file` vs `target directory`); the `Size() > 0` spelling SURVIVES (empty dirs report Size > 0) — rev2 withdrew the wrong spelling. FINDING (D14): scripted shape is COMPILE-FAIL (unused import), superseded by killing D14b.\n+- EVIDENCE: 5 FILE resources — `TASK-260830-2ciy0s_secprim-rev3.md` (31/31 AC rows with call sites, 22/29 rules narrowing-covered, R12 double probe, Windows escape-capable set + AF_UNIX/DEDUP counterexamples), battery py + log (59 killed/61 applied; N7 survives w/ bound), full-test + race logs.\n+- GATES: `go test ./...` exit 0 (20 pkgs), `-cover` exit 0 (secprim 94.4%), `-race` secprim+cliresult exit 0, `go vet` + `GOOS=windows go vet/build` exit 0, gofmt clean, `tracecheck` exit 0. Tree OID `7cae2bfa` identical across battery, plants, probes, finish.\n+- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off to review (review/landing are orchestrator steps).\n+\n+### 1553 — Shared-environment boundary round-2 rework: admit hole closed by delegation, shape census, 27-mutant battery\n"}}}
